#!name= 𝗧𝗼𝗸𝘆𝗼 𝗟𝗼𝗰𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻 𝗦𝗽𝗼𝗼𝗳𝗲𝗿
#!desc= 𝗯𝘆 𝗮𝗹𝗲𝗼𝗼

[MITM]
hostname = %APPEND% gs-loc.apple.com, gs-loc-cn.apple.com, bluedot.is.autonavi.com, bluedot.is.autonavi.com.gds.alibabadns.com

[Script]
Tokyo-Spoofer=type=http-response,pattern=^https?:\/\/(?:gs-loc(?:-cn)?\.apple\.com|bluedot\.is\.autonavi\.com(?:\.gds\.alibabadns\.com)?)\/clls\/wloc(?:\?.*)?$,requires-body=1,binary-body-mode=1,max-size=1048576,timeout=10,script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aleotoidayy/nghluan/aleoo/tokyo-spoofer.js
